<speak>Mostly the practical running. My niece has joined us, and she is very capable, but the older staff still come to me first. They ask me about stationery, meeting rooms, delivery paperwork, even who has the spare key to a cabinet. None of it sounds like much on its own. Put it all together, though, and a morning disappears. I want her to have proper responsibility, not merely a title while I continue answering every question behind the scenes.</speak>